{
  "page": 311,
  "lang": "ar",
  "edition": "quran-uthmani",
  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 2327,
      "text": "Have you seen the one[22] who rejects Our verses and says, “I will surely be given wealth and children [if I am resurrected]?”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 77,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 311,
      "ruku": 268,
      "hizbQuarter": 124,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2328,
      "text": "Has he obtained knowledge of the unseen, or has he taken a pledge with the Most Compassionate?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 78,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 311,
      "ruku": 268,
      "hizbQuarter": 124,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2329,
      "text": "Never! We will write down what he says and will prolong his punishment extensively.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 79,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 311,
      "ruku": 268,
      "hizbQuarter": 124,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2330,
      "text": "We will inherit what he boasts of[23], and he will come to Us all alone.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 80,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 311,
      "ruku": 268,
      "hizbQuarter": 124,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2331,
      "text": "They have taken gods other than Allah, in order that they may protect them [from punishment].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 81,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 311,
      "ruku": 268,
      "hizbQuarter": 124,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2332,
      "text": "Never! They will deny their worship and will become their enemies.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 82,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 311,
      "ruku": 268,
      "hizbQuarter": 124,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2333,
      "text": "Do you not see that We sent devils against the disbelievers constantly inciting them to sin?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 83,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 311,
      "ruku": 269,
      "hizbQuarter": 124,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2334,
      "text": "So do not be in haste about them; We are surely counting down their days[24].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 84,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 311,
      "ruku": 269,
      "hizbQuarter": 124,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2335,
      "text": "The Day when We will gather the righteous before the Most Compassionate as honored guests,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 85,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 311,
      "ruku": 269,
      "hizbQuarter": 124,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2336,
      "text": "and We will drive the wicked to Hell like a thirsty herd.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 86,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 311,
      "ruku": 269,
      "hizbQuarter": 124,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2337,
      "text": "None will have the power to intercede except those who have taken permission from the Most Compassionate[25].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 87,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 311,
      "ruku": 269,
      "hizbQuarter": 124,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2338,
      "text": "They say, “The Most Compassionate has begotten a son.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 88,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 311,
      "ruku": 269,
      "hizbQuarter": 124,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2339,
      "text": "You have made a monstrous statement,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 89,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 311,
      "ruku": 269,
      "hizbQuarter": 124,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2340,
      "text": "at which the heavens are about to be torn apart, the earth split asunder, and the mountains tumble down.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 90,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 311,
      "ruku": 269,
      "hizbQuarter": 124,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2341,
      "text": "because they have ascribed to the Most Compassionate a son.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 91,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 311,
      "ruku": 269,
      "hizbQuarter": 124,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2342,
      "text": "It is not appropriate for the Most Compassionate to beget a son.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 92,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 311,
      "ruku": 269,
      "hizbQuarter": 124,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2343,
      "text": "There is none in the heavens and earth except that he will come to the Most Compassionate in full submission.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 93,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 311,
      "ruku": 269,
      "hizbQuarter": 124,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2344,
      "text": "He has counted them and numbered them precisely.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 94,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 311,
      "ruku": 269,
      "hizbQuarter": 124,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2345,
      "text": "Each one of them will come to Him on the Day of Resurrection all alone.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 19,
        "name": "سُورَةُ مَرۡيَمَ",
        "englishName": "Maryam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mary",
        "numberOfAyahs": 98,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
